# Environment Variables Template

# Optional: Upstash Redis for production caching
# Get from: https://console.upstash.com/
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://[hash].upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_token_here

# Optional: Metals API for real gold prices
# Get from: https://metals-api.com/
# METALS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Optional: EIA API for real oil prices
# Get from: https://www.eia.gov/opendata/
# EIA_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Note: If these are not set, the app will use:
# - In-memory cache for dev (Vercel will use no cache)
# - Mock data for gold and oil prices
